1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,841
Sixteen years later, Avery, MacLeod and McCarty repeated it in test tubes and destroyed one kind of molecule at a time.

2
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:12,799
Destroy the protein: transformation still happens.

3
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:15,872
Destroy the RNA: it still happens.

4
00:00:15,872 --> 00:00:19,466
Destroy the DNA, with DNase, and it stops.

5
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:22,252
The transforming principle was DNA.

